    User -->|1. Uploads PDF| StreamlitApp
    StreamlitApp --> DocManager
    DocManager -->|Save raw PDF| StorageMgr
    DocManager -->|Extract pages| PDFExtract
    PDFExtract -->|Raw text & pages| Chunker
    Chunker -->|Text chunks + metadata| STModel
    STModel -->|384d Normalized Vectors| FAISSStore

    User -->|2. Submits natural language query| ChatInterface
    ChatInterface --> AdaptiveEngine
    AdaptiveEngine -->|Query text| STModel
    STModel -->|Query vector| AdaptiveEngine
    AdaptiveEngine -->|Cosine similarity search| FAISSStore
    FAISSStore -->|Top-K candidate chunks| AdaptiveEngine
    
    AdaptiveEngine -->|Evidence & Confidence| PromptAssembler
    PromptAssembler -->|Context + Prompt + Guardrails| GeminiClient
    GeminiClient -.->|If API unavailable| OfflineSynth
    GeminiClient -->|Synthesized Grounded Answer| ChatInterface
    OfflineSynth -->|Synthesized Evidence| ChatInterface
    ChatInterface -->|Display answer + source citations + latency| User
    ChatInterface -->|Update latency & escalation metrics| DiagDashboard
